31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, I have something important to say. I'm the Seer, and I checked Asuka-san. She is the werewolf!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...What? Already?,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is a very bold claim. You could be the werewolf trying to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, such a shocking start to the morning.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Yumi-chan, are you sure? It's very early to be so certain.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm absolutely sure! I saw it with my own eyes during the divination!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Asuka... is that true?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Of course it isn't. Yumi is likely the werewolf or the possessed trying to lead the vote.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It's hard to know who to believe when the accusations start so quickly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If Yumi is the Seer, we should listen. But if she's lying, we lose a villager.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I promise I'm telling the truth! Please, we have to vote for Asuka-san!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to believe Yumi-chan, but I'm scared of making a mistake.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Think logically. If I were the werewolf, would I be this obvious? Yumi's aggression is suspicious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Asuka-san is very calm, as always. But Yumi-chan seems very sincere.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke-kun, what do you think? You've been very quiet.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Please trust me! Asuka is the one we need to remove!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll trust Yumi-chan.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,This is an illogical conclusion based on a single claim.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I think I will trust our dear Yumi-chan. She has a kind heart.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go with the majority. I believe Yumi-chan.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
